The tester's run (8 Oct, conv 44420, 1 of 3): „რისი ცოდნა გინდა ჩემზე?" —
the profile question went out only as a live step bubble, and the kept
message said „ვუცდი შენს პასუხს." over five answer buttons; once the bubble
was gone the owner saw buttons and no question.

A reply with buttons that asks nothing takes the last question a step of
the same run asked, at its top. The step goes only when it said nothing
else; one with more in it keeps its words. No new text.

